<title>UK: DATED BRENT TRADES FIRMER AT SEPT BRENT - 5 CENTS.</title>
<headline>DATED BRENT TRADES FIRMER AT SEPT BRENT - 5 CENTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent traded firmer on Thursday as a late month cargo was sold at a narrower discount to Sept paper, traders said.</p>
<p>An Aug 28-30 cargo fetched Sept Brent -5 cents, seven cents firmer than a deal on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Both Aug 29-31 cargoes due to turn wet on Thursday, the last from the August programme, were kept early by equity holders Shell and Exxon, the traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
